<title>USA: Bucyrus Intl to buy Marion Power Shovel.</title>
<headline>Bucyrus Intl to buy Marion Power Shovel.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTH MILWAUKEE, Wis. 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bucyrus International Inc said Tuesday it signed a letter of intent to buy Marion Power Shovel Co from Global Indusrial Technologies Inc.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Global previously said the sale of Marion would complete its exit from the mining equipment business. Subject to board approval, both Bucyrus and Global expect to sign a definitive agreement by June 1.</p>
<p>Bucyrus manufactures surface mining equipment.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
